{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/10ce74a5729a18d936f6fcd29cabbdab.avif?t=1758812575\" width=609 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cater Co. is a <strong>stress-free</strong> <strong>cooking management</strong> game where you cut, mix, and cook the ingredients to fulfill your customers' orders. There is no timer, so take as much time as you want. Set up your own menu, upgrade your equipment and automate your recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/ad30cc3c54da7d9a1d65c2f24e932b82.poster.avif?t=1758812575\" width=608 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/ad30cc3c54da7d9a1d65c2f24e932b82.webm?t=1758812575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/ad30cc3c54da7d9a1d65c2f24e932b82.mp4?t=1758812575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A mysterious stranger left you their shop ...and it came with a &quot;cat&quot;... ?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/fa54de8c8e1be5600907bc21c3eea3a3.poster.avif?t=1758812575\" width=608 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934330/extras/fa54de8c8e1be5600907bc21c3eea3a3.webm?t=1758812575\